{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4uEBKEB8x6nVWscoeH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, scarred by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*You speak the word.*\n\n**\"Key.\"**\n\n*A low resonance hums through the wood. The iron bands shiver. Rust falls like dried blood.*\n\n*But the door does not open.*\n\n*Instead, letters burn themselves into the surface, glowing amber from within:*\n\n---\n\n**WHICH KEY?**\n\n**A key is only a shape until it knows its lock.**\n\n**Name the teeth. Name the ward. Name what you wish to pass through to.**\n\n**I am every door. I am no door. I am the door you named, and you named me without a name.**\n\n**Speak again — but this time, mean it.**\n\n---\n\n*The grain of the wood shifts, revealing what might be a keyhole — or an eye — or a mouth waiting to taste the right word.*\n\n*The hinges groan, not with age, but with anticipation.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":225,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}